    <title>Known Bugs</title>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><variablelist>
<varlistentry><term><anchor id="bug_1_bug000003"/>Class <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_asset_swap" kindref="compound">AssetSwap</ref>  </term></varlistentry>
<listitem><para>fair prices are not calculated correctly when using indexed coupons.  </para></listitem>
<varlistentry><term><anchor id="bug_1_bug000011"/>Class <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_black_calculator" kindref="compound">BlackCalculator</ref>  </term></varlistentry>
<listitem><para>When the variance is null, division by zero occur during the calculation of delta, delta forward, gamma, gamma forward, rho, dividend rho, vega, and strike sensitivity.  </para></listitem>
<varlistentry><term><anchor id="bug_1_bug000005"/>Class <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_cap_helper" kindref="compound">CapHelper</ref>  </term></varlistentry>
<listitem><para>This helper does not register with the passed IBOR index and with the evaluation date. Furthermore, the ATM strike rate is not recalculated when any of its observables change.  </para></listitem>
<varlistentry><term><anchor id="bug_1_bug000007"/>Class <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_cox_ingersoll_ross" kindref="compound">CoxIngersollRoss</ref>  </term></varlistentry>
